{"seq":3,"slug":"incentive-abuse-budget-guardrail","title":"激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/incentive-content-decision/incentive-abuse-budget-guardrail","wordCount":3101,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置\">激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置</h1><p>一张 15% 的挽回券被同一个设备在凌晨三点兑换四百次，营销预算在六小时内烧掉当月配额——这不是风控团队的假设演练，而是任何开放在线兑换的挽回引擎迟早会遇到的一夜。上一篇把折扣深度钉在单位经济学上（见 <a href=\"incentive-elasticity-margin-framework\">激励类型与折扣弹性/毛利约束决策框架</a>），那套推导默认「每张券发给了它该发给的人」；本文处理这个默认被打破时的两件事：<strong>阻止不该拿券的人拿券</strong>（羊毛防控），以及<strong>在已经失控时让损失有上界</strong>（预算护栏与熔断）。防控决定单位成本，护栏决定总敞口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-羊毛的三种来源与它们各自的经济学\">核心概念：羊毛的三种来源与它们各自的经济学</h2><p>「羊毛」在跨境挽回场景里不是一个统一的敌人，而是三类动机、成本结构、可见性完全不同的行为，混为一谈会让防控措施打偏。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多账号套利（multi-accounting）</strong>：同一自然人或脚本用批量注册的新邮箱、新手机号反复领取「仅限一次」的告白券。这是最普遍的形态，Sardine 2026 年的分析明确指出它是 promo abuse 最常见的形式，并归类为第一方欺诈——施害者用的是自己或伪造的身份，而非盗用的身份与支付工具（Sardine, <em>Promo Abuse</em>, 2026-06-01）。</li>\n<li><strong>有组织的代领与转售</strong>：设备农场、合成身份、以及把优惠码输送到折扣站和社交渠道的「码贩子」，让本应面向老客的券流向全网比价者。</li>\n<li><strong>无恶意的溢出</strong>：一个用户在小红书分享了自己的专属码，或者一串码被搜索引擎索引——没有攻击者，但券的定向性被彻底摧毁。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三类行为的单位损失与防控抓手差异极大，塞进一条规则只会要么误伤老客、要么放过农场。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>触发机制</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>单位损失</th>\n<th>主防控手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多账号套利</td>\n<td>一次性券不限身份重复领取</td>\n<td>同设备/同地址多账号、脚本化邮箱模式</td>\n<td>优惠成本 × 账号数</td>\n<td>设备指纹、领取实体唯一性、延迟核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有组织代领/转售</td>\n<td>码流入折扣站与转售渠道</td>\n<td>单码短时跨地域高频核销、渠道集中度异常</td>\n<td>预算被挤占 + 定向失效</td>\n<td>码级速率限制、渠道 KYB、图谱聚簇封禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无恶意溢出</td>\n<td>用户分享、爬虫索引公开码</td>\n<td>码搜索热度、自然流量核销上升</td>\n<td>定向性丧失</td>\n<td>单次码、绑定账号、短 TTL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键认识是：<strong>只有第一类需要「识别坏人」，第二、三类主要靠「让码本身不可复用」</strong>。单次码、账号绑定、短时效把「有没有坏人」转成「这张码天生能被用几次」——构造成本最低、误伤最小，应先于任何风控模型存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别信号-从设备指纹到网络图聚簇\">识别信号：从设备指纹到网络图聚簇</h2><p>当码的设计无法彻底消除复用空间时，识别就上场了。信号分三层，按获取成本与稳定性递增。<strong>第一层是设备与行为信号</strong>：持久化设备指纹（而非可清空的 cookie）、行为生物特征（打字节奏、滑动轨迹）、以及「重置行为」检测——一个账号领券后立刻清空浏览器存储本身就是信号。这类信号比身份更难伪造，但需妥善处理删除请求，不能做成不可删除的超级 cookie。<strong>第二层是实体链接</strong>：邮箱、手机号、收货地址、支付工具构成一张图，多个「不同账号」在图上靠得过近（共用地址、手机号序列相邻、邮箱由同一批低信誉域名生成）就应被当作一个簇，处置作用于簇而非单个账号。Sardine 把网络图聚簇连同合成身份识别列为防控的第二支柱。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是聚合统计的异常</strong>。单看一个兑换请求往往看不出问题，但放进时间窗就会露馅：注册量「某个周二暴涨 400% 且留存极低」、某个附属合作方突然贡献了「30% 的核销」——这些都是设备农场和渠道洗码在聚合层面的指纹（Sardine, 2026）。这类检测无需识别任何个体，只需要一个能按渠道、按设备簇、按时间窗聚合核销数据的账本。它也是后文预算护栏的同一套数据底座：<strong>没有按维度的核销账本，既做不了异常检测，也做不了护栏</strong>。</p>\n<p>需要警惕的是同一条信号在跨境场景下的含义漂移。一个真实的多国用户可能自然地使用 VPN、多个收货地址和多个本地手机号——这些在单一市场是强信号，在跨境场景可能是正常行为。把某一市场的阈值直接搬到另一个市场是误伤的最大来源；阈值必须按来源国、支付方式和客单价分层标定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定与处置状态机-分级而非二值\">判定与处置状态机：分级而非二值</h2><p>把上面三层信号汇入一个<strong>分级的处置阶梯</strong>，比「通过/拒绝」的二值判定重要得多。二值判定的代价是：一旦误判，要么放过羊毛，要么把高意图真客拒之门外，而后者的损失（永久流失一个本要下单的客户）往往高于前者的节省。因此处置动作应是一组按「用户可感知摩擦」排序的档位，越靠后越激进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[兑换请求进入] --&gt; B{码预检&lt;br/&gt;有效性/额度/时效}&#10;  B --&gt;|无效或超限| R1[拒绝&lt;br/&gt;统一失败码]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C{设备与实体信号}&#10;  C --&gt;|低风险| D[直接放行]&#10;  C --&gt;|中风险| E[静默挑战&lt;br/&gt;CAPTCHA/3DS]&#10;  C --&gt;|高风险| F[延迟核销&lt;br/&gt;冻结待复核]&#10;  E --&gt;|挑战通过| D&#10;  E --&gt;|挑战失败| G[限流&lt;br/&gt;同设备短时拒绝]&#10;  F --&gt; H{人工或异步复核}&#10;  H --&gt;|确认正常| D&#10;  H --&gt;|确认异常| I[撤销券并拉黑实体]&#10;  D --&gt; J{预算护栏校验}&#10;  J --&gt;|消耗率正常| K[记账并出券]&#10;  J --&gt;|逼近阈值| L[降级&lt;br/&gt;改写为内容型激励]&#10;  J --&gt;|击穿阈值| M[熔断&lt;br/&gt;暂停该折扣档位]\">flowchart TD\n  A[兑换请求进入] --&gt; B{码预检&lt;br/&gt;有效性/额度/时效}\n  B --&gt;|无效或超限| R1[拒绝&lt;br/&gt;统一失败码]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C{设备与实体信号}\n  C --&gt;|低风险| D[直接放行]\n  C --&gt;|中风险| E[静默挑战&lt;br/&gt;CAPTCHA/3DS]\n  C --&gt;|高风险| F[延迟核销&lt;br/&gt;冻结待复核]\n  E --&gt;|挑战通过| D\n  E --&gt;|挑战失败| G[限流&lt;br/&gt;同设备短时拒绝]\n  F --&gt; H{人工或异步复核}\n  H --&gt;|确认正常| D\n  H --&gt;|确认异常| I[撤销券并拉黑实体]\n  D --&gt; J{预算护栏校验}\n  J --&gt;|消耗率正常| K[记账并出券]\n  J --&gt;|逼近阈值| L[降级&lt;br/&gt;改写为内容型激励]\n  J --&gt;|击穿阈值| M[熔断&lt;br/&gt;暂停该折扣档位]</pre><p>这条阶梯有三条设计原则。<strong>其一，拒绝不泄露原因</strong>：返回统一失败码，否则攻击者可据此做梯度探测、逐档试出阈值。<strong>其二，静默挑战优先于硬拒绝</strong>：CAPTCHA 或 3DS 步进验证对真客可完成、对农场昂贵，把成本推给攻击者而不损失真客——与「抬高羊毛成本、摧毁其投资回报」的整体策略一致。<strong>其三，延迟核销把时间变成筛子</strong>：对可疑请求冻结待复核而非立即发券，羊毛团伙追求即时批量变现，延迟显著拉低其周转效率，而真客通常几步操作后仍能拿到券。每次处置都必须留痕并绑定<strong>可逆性</strong>：撤销的券、黑名单实体、被限流设备都需要明确的恢复路径与人工申诉入口——误封一个真实高价值客户的代价，一张 15% 券赎不回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算护栏-把激励敞口关进可运维的笼子里\">预算护栏：把激励敞口关进可运维的笼子里</h2><p>防控降低的是「不该发的券」的比例，护栏管的是「无论如何损失也不能超过某个数」。这是一个<strong>独立的第二道防线</strong>：即使识别全部失灵，护栏也必须保证损失有上界。核心量是激励的<strong>燃耗率（burn rate）</strong>——单位时间内被核销的激励总成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(t) = \\sum_{i} n_i(t)\\,\\cdot\\, \\bar{P}_i \\,\\cdot\\, d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个档位在时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的核销量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{P}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其平均客单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其折扣深度。有了燃耗率，两个派生量即可驱动告警：<strong>预算消耗比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = B/B_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，以及<strong>按当前燃耗率的预计耗尽时间</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>exh</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{exh}} = t + \\frac{B_{\\text{cap}} - B(t)}{\\dot{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2372em;vertical-align:-0.8102em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8102em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>护栏规则是「当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\ge \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{B} &gt; \\dot{B}_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9593em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0702em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时触发降级」。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是消耗比阈值（经验上取 0.8 留出处置窗口），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{B}_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0702em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的最大瞬时燃耗率——它比消耗比更早发现问题：一个正常每天烧 2% 预算的档位，如果一小时烧掉 10%，那是典型的攻击签名，应当在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 还很低时就熔断。</p>\n<p>与燃耗并行的是一个<strong>羊毛率闸门</strong>。设时间窗内核销总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，被风控标记的核销数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，羊毛率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = N_f / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f &gt; f_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，说明当前折扣档位正被批量滥用，处置不是逐个封账号，而是<strong>换用抗滥用的激励形态</strong>——把百分比折扣降级为单次码、账号绑定或内容型激励。这正是护栏必须与激励类型系统联动的原因：护栏触发的不是「关掉一切」，而是「切换到该档位上滥用风险最低的激励」——零边际成本的内容型激励（运费透明提示、库存紧迫、社会证明）永远是熔断时的安全垫，因为它不触碰毛利。</p>\n<p>一个必须防的反模式是<strong>护栏本身被绕过的路径</strong>。如果券的核销可以发生在服务端之外（线下扫码、第三方渠道），燃耗账本就漏了这些维度，护栏形同虚设。Sardine 提示的风险信号之一是附属渠道里「某个小合作方突然占 30% 核销」——这既是滥用信号，也说明核销账本必须按渠道维度切分，否则渠道洗码会从盲区流走。运维上，熔断开关必须能按档位、按渠道、按地域独立触发；全局熔断一次误操作，代价可能是整月挽回归零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-异常处置手册与跨境合规边界\">小结：异常处置手册与跨境合规边界</h2><p>护栏报警的那一刻，真正决定损失大小的是<strong>处置手册是否被预先写下来并有单一执行人</strong>。真实存在的一种模式是：凌晨燃耗率突增，值班同学先「观察一下」，等确认是攻击时预算已烧掉六成。因此手册第一条是<strong>授权预置</strong>——谁有权在无人复核下直接触发熔断，触发后多久必须复评。手册应包含：熔断动作（暂停哪些档位、保留哪些）、已发券的回收策略（是否作废未核销券、是否追回）、对外沟通口径、以及复盘所需留存的证据维度（时间窗、设备簇、渠道、码 ID）。</p>\n<p>跨境场景给这套手册叠加了两层合规约束，都直接限制「你用什么手段防控」。<strong>第一层是定价透明度</strong>：用消费史推断支付意愿来差异化发券，经济学上是三级价格歧视（Pigou, <em>The Economics of Welfare</em>, 1929），并已被证明可用消费者评分实现（Bonatti &amp; Cisternas, <em>Review of Economic Studies</em> 87(2), 2020, pp. 750–791）。它多数情形合法，但欧盟《数字服务法》（Regulation (EU) 2022/2065）禁止面向消费者的「欺骗性设计」，并于 2025 年 12 月对 X 开出首张含欺骗性设计认定的罚单（其中 €45M 归于该认定），最高罚则为全球年营业额的 6%；用虚假紧迫或虚假原价制造折扣感，风险已从营销噪音升级为监管敞口。<strong>第二层是负面选项（订阅）规则的波动</strong>：美国 FTC 于 2024-10-16 发布 Click-to-Cancel 最终规则（16 CFR Part 425），随后因法院判决于 2026 年 2 月启动修订并撤回、2026-03-11 发布拟议规则制定预告（ANPRM，案卷号 FTC-2026-0265）；依赖订阅或会员制的挽回激励，条款文本必须按最新版本核对。</p>\n<p>由此得到一条实操准则：<strong>能证明的优惠才能发</strong>。当法务与风控共用一套「发放理由」记录——用户在哪一步弃购、触发了哪条规则、券的依据是什么——合规审计与羊毛复盘就共用同一份证据，不必事后重建。最后，护栏参数本身需要监控：从不触发和人人都在触发的阈值，都是坏参数。定期用留出组的真实燃耗分布重新标定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{B}_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0702em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让护栏保持「偶尔挡下真攻击、几乎不误伤正常活动」的状态。</p>\n<p>本文的防控与护栏都建立在「弃购人群已被正确分层」的前提上——分层信号来自 <a href=\"../abandonment-detection-event-identity/abandonment-funnel-stage-taxonomy\">弃购漏斗阶段定义与可挽回性分类模型</a>；券在两轮之间的派发节奏与频次约束决定了滥用的时间窗大小，见 <a href=\"../recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/cross-channel-dispatch-frequency-cap\">跨渠道派发与频次上限</a>；而被降级为内容型激励后具体发什么，见 <a href=\"dynamic-offer-content-personalization\">动态优惠与内容个性化</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置","id":"激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：羊毛的三种来源与它们各自的经济学","id":"核心概念-羊毛的三种来源与它们各自的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"识别信号：从设备指纹到网络图聚簇","id":"识别信号-从设备指纹到网络图聚簇"},{"level":2,"text":"判定与处置状态机：分级而非二值","id":"判定与处置状态机-分级而非二值"},{"level":2,"text":"预算护栏：把激励敞口关进可运维的笼子里","id":"预算护栏-把激励敞口关进可运维的笼子里"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：异常处置手册与跨境合规边界","id":"小结-异常处置手册与跨境合规边界"}],"prev":{"title":"动态优惠与个性化内容/商品推荐决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/incentive-content-decision/dynamic-offer-content-personalization"},"next":{"title":"挽回归因与增量性度量（自然转化剥离）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/attribution-measurement-compliance-exp/recovery-attribution-incrementality"}}